  message: "Root causes largely addressed: INV-popop (stable_id collisions fixed), WI-lodik (route materialization). Remaining risk: some node types may still produce hash-format IDs in compact. Needs bakeoff revalidation to confirm. Downgrading to soft since the structural fixes are in place."  # f8a3
