  message: "Code audit confirms route symbols use location-based id (not hash) for edge endpoints. routes_to edges reference route.id and handler.id correctly. Root cause was likely INV-popop (stable_id collisions) or missing route materialization (WI-lodik). Both fixed. Downgrading — needs revalidation to confirm."  # 6d87
